{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2022-03-16 16:31:00', 'title': 'KEYCORP RAISES ITS PRIME LENDING RATE TO 3.50 PERCENT', 'text': "CLEVELAND , MARCH 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KEYCORP (NYSE: KEY) AND ITS BANKING AFFILIATES HAVE RAISED THEIR PRIME LENDING RATE TO 3.50 PERCENT FROM 3.25 PERCENT, EFFECTIVE TOMORROW, MARCH 17, 2022. ABOUT KEYCORP KEYCORP'S ROOTS TRACE BACK NEARLY 200 YEARS TO ALBANY, NEW YORK."}